{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久保史緒里です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ920CN3KN1W0NGEETPYXGG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏が終わりを迎えようとしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気がつけば9月。\n特別な月がやってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ921AYW5DXH85HSPPCAFE7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月4日で\n3期生は6周年を迎えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで色々あったけど、\n今みんなと笑い合いながら\nステージに立てていることが素直に嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遡ること5年前。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての明治神宮野球場。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日、\nステージで私達が口にした言葉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"もっともっと強くなりたい\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"変わっていく私を見て欲しい\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"毎日が不安でいっぱい\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"先輩方が誇りです\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"先輩たちみたいに尊敬される人になりたい\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"大好きな乃木坂46\n私がもっと最高のグループにします\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"私の運命を変えてくれた先輩方は\n私の永遠の憧れです\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年前の言葉に嘘はひとつもなく、\n今も変わらない想いでいられることが\n何よりもしあわせです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩方の背中は、\n逞しくて、格好良くて、届かなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5期生のみんなには\n私たちの背中はどう映ってるんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々不安になるけれど、\nあの頃の先輩方の姿に\n少しでも近づけていたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ922AQ217EYXJ3ZY4ECHQZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2022。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方を巡り、\n共にする時間が重なっていく度に、\n愛おしくなるメンバー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、最高の仲間に出逢えたんだなと\n過去を振り返るだけで涙が滲むような\nそんな経験はここに来なければ出来なかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏は、\n愛が溢れる夏でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も、乃木坂46と共に\n熱い夏を過ごしてくださり、\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラスト、明治神宮野球場。\nこの夏の最高の思い出を\n一緒に作りましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこまでも続く、\n持て余すくらいに大きい空の下。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大好きな、あの歌を歌います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未来への希望を胸に。\n私の背中にも\n使ってない羽根があると信じて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久保史緒里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ眠る可能性"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無限大だ"}],"source":"archive"}